    "chunk_text": "Ac \u00fea consulas noldon hie selfe swa earge ge\u00feencan swa hie \u00fea wifmen \u00e6r forcw\u00e6don, \u00fe\u00e6t hi Ac \u00fea hie tog\u00e6dere woldon, \u00fea com swa ungemetlic ren, \u00fe\u00e6t heora nan ne mehte nanes w\u00e6pnes \u00dea se ren ablon, hie foran eft tog\u00e6dere, & eft wear\u00f0 o\u00feer swelc ren, \u00fe\u00e6t hie eft toforan. \u00dea angeat Hannibal, & him self s\u00e6de, \u00f0eh \u00f0e he wilniende w\u00e6re & wenende Romana Gesecga\u00f0 me nu Romane, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, hwonne \u00fe\u00e6t gewurde o\u00fe\u00fee hwara, \u00e6r \u00f0\u00e6m Hit w\u00e6s \u00feeh swi\u00fee sweotol \u00fe\u00e6t se ilca Crist se \u00fee hie eft to cristendome onwende, \u00fe\u00e6t se him On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum \u00fee \u00feis gewear\u00f0, w\u00e6ron twegen consulas ofslagen on Ispania, \u00fea w\u00e6ron On \u00fe\u00e6re tide Cuintus Fuluius se consul geegsade ealle \u00fea ieldestan men \u00fee on Campaina & ealle \u00fea ieldestan men \u00fee w\u00e6ron on Capu \u00fe\u00e6re byrg he ofslog, for \u00feon \u00fee he wende \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00dea Romane geacsedan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea consulas on Ispanium ofslagen w\u00e6ron, \u00fea ne mehton \u00fea senatus Se w\u00e6s georne biddende \u00fe\u00e6t him mon fultum sealde, \u00fe\u00e6t he moste on Ispanie fird gel\u00e6dan, & Ac Romane w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6s f\u00e6reltes swa geornfulle, \u00feeh \u00fee hie swi\u00f0e gebrocode w\u00e6ren on hiora \u00dea Scipia h\u00e6fde gefaren to \u00f0\u00e6re niwan byrig Cartaina, \u00fee mon nu Cordofa h\u00e6tt, he bes\u00e6tt B",
